          },
          {
            "type": "soft-break",
            "span": {
              "start": 1326,
              "end": 1327
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "stderr, and tracebacks remain text. Supported images become local assets; unsafe",
            "span": {
              "start": 1327,
              "end": 1407
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "soft-break",
            "span": {
              "start": 1407,
              "end": 1408
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "HTML or SVG is rejected. A page cache can reuse a successful execution when its",
